ent-CentCommJustice = CC-21 'Judgement'
  .desc = An exorbitantly expensive self-recharging energy sword, designed exclusively for use by high-ranking Central Command personnel. Reportedly, the blade is a metallurgical miracle that incorporates pieces of a supermatter crystal...

ent-ClothingBeltSheathCentralCommand = Central Command Sheath
  .desc = A reinforced sheath designed to house the CC-21 'Judgement'. Lined with the same material used in the construction of the Chief Engineer's hardsuit.

